description:
Precautions:
Use only the built-in charger;
– no third-party/solar chargers.
Do not use dimmers/voltage regulators on the supply line;
– connect to clean 220–240 V AC.
Install indoors only;
– avoid outdoor/high-humidity/saline/corrosive environments.
Do not open or modify:
– the sealed battery compartment, BMS, or wiring.
Prevent terminal shorting;
– and accessories only.
Proper earthing required;
–  ensure a grounded neutral common across the premises.
Verify wiring & voltage quality;
– sustained over/under-voltage, surges, harmonics, or generator/inverter output outside spec can damage electronics—use a suitable stabilizer/UPS if needed.
Keep away from water/chemicals;
– do not clean with liquids/solvents; wipe with a dry/anti-static cloth.
Authorized installation only;
– improper mounting or weak ceiling structure can cause hazards.
Inverter/generator use:
– ensure waveform/voltage compatibility before connection.
Pest/rodent protection:
– prevent nesting/chewing near wiring and canopy
